<% content_for(:title, "こえの吹き込み｜こえだより") %>
<div class="flex items-start justify-center w-full min-h-screen">
  <div class="card bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-8 text-center">
    <div data-controller="recording" data-recording-slug-value="<%= params[:slug] %>">
      <h1 class="font-bold text-4xl text-center mb-4">こえの吹き込み</h1>
      <p class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">話す内容</p>
      <div class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-center hidden" data-recording-target="errorSection">
        ⚠️うまく届きませんでした。<br>ご家族に相談するか、もう一度吹き込んでください。
        <button data-recording-target="retryBtn" data-action="click->recording#retry" class="btn btn-error">再度こえをふきこむ</button>
      </div>
      <div class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-center hidden" data-recording-target="micErrorSection">
        ⚠️画面にマイクが内蔵されていません。画面右上の「...」から「他のブラウザで開く」を選んでご利用ください
      </div>
      <p class="text-3xl font-bold border-2 border-primary rounded-full px-6 py-2 block mb-4 text-center"><%= @theme.title %></p>
      <div data-recording-target="recordSection" class="text-center">
        <button data-recording-target="toggleBtn" data-action="click->recording#toggle" class="w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-success">
            <%= icon("mic", css_class: "text-white w-18 h-18 mx-auto mb-2") %>
          <p class="text-white text-2xl font-bold">ここを押して<br>こえをふきこむ</p>
        </button>

        <div data-recording-target="timer" class="text-center text-2xl mt-4"></div>
      </div>
        <div data-recording-target="completeSection" class="hidden">
          <div class="relative w-64 h-64 mx-auto">
            <svg class="w-64 h-64 -rotate-90" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45" fill="none" stroke="#e5e7eb" stroke-width="8" />
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45" fill="none" stroke-width="8"
                      stroke-dasharray="283" stroke-dashoffset="283"
                      class="text-success animate-draw-circle" stroke="currentColor" />
            </svg>

            <%= icon("check", css_class: "text-success w-24 h-24 absolute inset-0 m-auto") %>
          </div>

          <p class="text-center text-2xl mt-4">こえを受け取りました<br>ご家族にとどけます</p>
          <%= link_to "前の画面に戻る", speaker_path(params[:slug]), class: "btn btn-primary flex mx-auto text-xl mt-4" %>
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
